.io/ev-mercury/Z7NwtJ7c43Q3f4F2_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-34ee7b.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7NwtJ7c43Q3f4F2_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-34.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C6240%2C4150&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7NwtJ7c43Q3f4F2_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-34.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C6240%2C4150&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z7NwtJ7c43Q3f4F2_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-34.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C5%2C6240%2C4150&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri warehouse employee wearing high vis is transporting a pallet carrying a crate of parcels. He is walking in the background with cages full of parcels in the foreground. " width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Put your warehouse to work this peak period</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Evri is seeking experienced warehouse operatives with available space to support parcel sortation and collection during our busiest months—October through January. With delivery volumes surging around key seasonal events like Black Friday and Christmas, we’re looking to collaborate with reliable partners who can help keep parcels moving efficiently.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you have spare capacity and are interested in a compensated partnership, we’d love to hear from you.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Get sta