-you?" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral conditional-section-wrapper" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3ColumnWithoutLinks" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->What&#39;s in it for you?<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--v-if--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z_k_kuvxEdbNO7uq_59d5cc.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z_k_kuvxEdbNO7uq_59.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C1624%2C1080&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z_k_kuvxEdbNO7uq_59.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C1624%2C1080&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z_k_kuvxEdbNO7uq_59.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C0%2C1624%2C1080&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Generate additional revenue<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our warehouse partners can generate over £10,000 in additional income during the peak period. These bonus earnings can help you scale your operations, increase capacity, and play a key role in delivering parcels to communities across the UK.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!----></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z_k_kevxEdbNO7un_213416.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z_k_kevxEdbNO7un_21.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=148%2C0%2C1624%2C1080&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z_k_kevxEdbNO7un_21.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=148%2C0%2C1624%2C1080&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z_k_kevxEdbNO7un_21.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=148%2C0%2C1624%2C1080&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Flexible, scalable partnerships<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->At Evri, we value strong, supportive relationships with our warehouse partners. Our seasonal business model means we understand the need for flexibility—helping you scale up or down based on your capacity. Together, we can make the most of the opportunities this fast-moving industry offers.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!----></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aCRu7idWJ-7kSD4J_0Z9_0955-Edit8c49.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aCRu7idWJ-7kSD4J_0Z9_0955-Edit.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C7%2C7789%2C5180&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aCRu7idWJ-7kSD4J_0Z9_0955-Edit.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C7%2C7789%2C5180&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aCRu7idWJ-7kSD4J_0Z9_0955-Edit.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C7%2C7789%2C5180&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Martijn de Lange, CEO of Evri, with Pablo Ciano, CEO of DHL eCommerce in front of Evri and DHL vehicles" width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Be part of a trusted, successful and growing network<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->In 2024, Evri successfully delivered over 800 million parcels to satisfied customers, earning a 4.2-star rating on Trustpilot. With our continued commitment to service excellence and our exciting new merger with DHL, there’s never been a better time to become part of the Evri network.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!----></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="3" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="ideal-space-requirements" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-5d43a0fc>Ideal space requirements</h2><!----></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/368d77c0-145d-4481-a619-4399e853d1cb_lorry+-+facing+left.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Icon of a lorry turning left" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>24/7 ground level access with ample parking</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/9fb9d950-2c3e-4a43-a975-c773dd47adf3_friendly.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Friendly icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Access to welfare facilities</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/0b60c675-436d-4ca1-8857-2bfbff3cb847_followed_instructions.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="Followed instructions icon" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-