ces":14},"Turn Your Unused Warehouse Space Into An Extra £10,000+ | Evri","Evri is seeking warehouse operatives with available space to support parcel sortation and collection during our busiest months—October through January.","peak-warehouse-space.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpeak-warehouse-space",{"link_type":12},"Document",{"link_type":12},[15,50,77,135,179,221],{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":18,"primary":19,"id":48,"slice_type":49,"slice_label":20},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[],{"theme":20,"PageHeaderTitle":21,"PageHeaderText":22,"PageHeaderCtaText":28,"PageHeaderCtaUrl":29,"secondaryCtaText":20,"secondaryCtaLabel":20,"secondaryCtaUrl":33,"PageHeaderImage":35,"heroImage":46,"videoContent":47,"showPremiumLogo":20},null,"Turn your unused warehouse space into an extra £10,000+",[23],{"type":24,"text":25,"spans":26,"direction":27},"paragraph","Join our national courier network, serving as one of our key collection and sortation points. ",[],"ltr","Get in touch",{"link_type":30,"key":31,"url":32},"Web","82a3dd64-3b87-489e-aae2-8e614dae1ee2","mailto:propertysolutions@evri.com?subject=I'd%20like%20to%20earn%20an%20additional%20%C2%A310%2C000%2B%20with%20my%20unused%20warehouse%20space&body=With%20the%20following%20information%2C%20we%20can%20get%20started%20evaluating%20your%20unused%20warehouse%20space%20and%20onboarding%20you%20to%20get%20your%20warehouse%20up%20and%20running%20with%20Evri%20ahead%20of%20this%20peak%20season%3A%0A%0A%E2%80%A2%20Name%0A%E2%80%A2%20Business%20Name%0A%E2%80%A2%20Postcode%0A%E2%80%A2%20Floor%20Space%0A%E2%80%A2%20Available%20Parking%20Spaces%0A%E2%80%A2%20Desired%20Monthly%20Amount%0A%E2%80%A2%20Hours%2FDays%20the%20Space%20is%20available",{"link_type":34},"Any",{"dimensions":36,"alt":39,"copyright":20,"url":40,"id":41,"edit":42},{"width":37,"height":38},300,48,"Courier","peak-warehouse-space.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Feff4a723-3b6d-4211-ba31-e8279db0bdf5_courier.svg","YhYpMBIAACsA0QBu",{"x":43,"y":43,"zoom":44,"background":45},0,1,"transparent",{},{"link_type":12},"page_header$e69b953c-3238-4d58-9647-5b7dc9d6502e","page_header",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":51,"primary":52,"id":75,"slice_type":76,"slice_label":20},[],{"CardImage":53,"CardAvatar":62,"CardTitle":63,"CardText":64,"ButtonText":71,"ButtonUrl":72,"IsEco":74},{"dimensions":54,"alt":57,"copyright":20,"url":58,"id":59,"edit":60},{"width":55,"height":56},1000,665,"An Evri warehouse employee wearing high vis is transporting a pallet carrying a crate of parcels. He is walking in the background with cages full of parcels in the foreground. ","peak-warehouse-space.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7NwtJ7c43Q3f4F2_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-34.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C5%2C6240%2C4150&w=1000&h=665","Z7NwtJ7c43Q3f4F2",{"x":43,"y":61,"zoom":44,"background":45},5,"none","Put your warehouse to work this peak period",[65,68],{"type":24,"text":66,"spans":67,"direction":27},"Evri is seeking experienced warehouse operatives with available space to support parcel sortation and collection during our busiest months—October through January. With delivery volumes surging around key seasonal events like Black Friday and Christmas, we’re looking to collaborate with reliable partners who can help keep parcels moving efficiently.",[],{"type":24,"text":69,"spans":70,"direction":27},"If you have spare capacity and are interested in a compensated partnership, we’d love to hear from you.",[],"Get started today",{"link_type":30,"key":73,"url":32},"f02d5cef-f9ea-4dd2-8ae1-1ddfb014a48e",false,"card$22fc7778-aec0-41f9-ad1e-1fac789d36f4","card",{"variation":78,"version":17,"items":79,"primary":126,"id":133,"slice_type":134,"slice_label":20},"3ColumnWithoutLinks",[80,95,110],{"Title":81,"Description":86,"Image":90,"Label":20},[82],{"type":83,"text":84,"spans":85,"direction":27},"heading3","Generate additional revenue",[],[87],{"type":24,"text":88,"spans":89,"direction":27},"Our warehouse partners can generate over £10,000 in additional income during the peak period. These bonus earnings can help you scale your operations, increase capacity, and play a key role in delivering parcels to communities across the UK.",[],{"dimensions":91,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":92,"id":93,"edit":94},{"width":55,"height":56},"peak-warehouse-space.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ_k_kuvxEdbNO7uq_59.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C1624%2C1080&w=1000&h=665","Z_k_kuvxEdbNO7uq",{"x":43,"y":43,"zoom":44,"background":45},{"Title":96,"Description":100,"Image":104,"Label":20},[97],{"type":83,"text":98,"spans":99,"direction":27},"Flexible, scalable partnerships",[],[101],{"type":24,"text":102,"spans":103,"direction":27},"At Evri, we value strong, supportive relationships with our warehouse partners. Our seasonal business model means we understand the need for flexibility—helping you scale up or down based on your capacity. Together, we can make the most of the opportunities this fast-moving industry offers.",[],{"dimensions":105,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":106,"id":107,"edit":108},{"width":55,"height":56},"peak-warehouse-space.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ_k_kevxEdbNO7un_21.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=148%2C0%2C1624%2C1080&w=1000&h=665","Z_k_kevxEdbNO7un",{"x":109,"y":43,"zoom":44,"background":45},148,{"Title":111,"Description":115,"Image":119,"Label":20},[112],{"type":83,"text":113,"spans":114,"direction":27},"Be part of a trusted, successful and growing network",[],[116],{"type":24,"text":117,"spans":118,"direction":27},"In 2024, Evri successfully delivered over 800 million parcels to satisfied customers, earning a 4.2-star rating on Trustpilot. With our continued commitment to service excellence and our exciting new merger with DHL, there’s never been a better time to become part of the Evri network.",[],{"dimensions":120,"alt":121,"copyright":20,"url":122,"id":123,"edit":124},{"width":55,"height":56},"Martijn de Lange, CEO of Evri, with Pablo Ciano, CEO of DHL eCommerce in front of Evri and DHL vehicles","peak-warehouse-space.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaCRu7idWJ-7kSD4J_0Z9_0955-Edit.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C7%2C7789%2C5180&w=1000&h=665","aCRu7idWJ-7kSD4J",{"x":43,"y":125,"zoom":44,"background":45},7,{"SectionTitle":127,"SectionDescription":132,"theme":20},[128],{"type":129,"text":130,"spans":131,"direction":27},"heading2","What's in it for you?",[],[],"article_link_module$b6cf66c1-ceaf-45af-b31c-49701f9f7b50","article_link_module",{"variation":136,"version":17,"items":137,"primary":175,"id":177,"slice_type":178,"slice_label":20},"listComponent",[138,148,157,166],{"title":139,"content":140,"icon":141},"24\u002F7 ground level access with ample parking",[],{"dimensions":142,"alt":144,"copyright":20,"url":145,"id":146,"edit":147},{"width":143,"height":143},40,"Icon of a lorry turning left","peak-warehouse-space.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F368d77c0-145d-4481-a619-4399e853d1cb_lorry+-+facing+left.svg","Yh96FhIAAC8A-Zr6",{"x":43,"y":43,"zoom":44,"background":45},{"title":149,"content":150,"icon":151},"Access to welfare facilities",[],{"dimensions":152,"alt":153,"copyright":20,"url":154,"id":155,"edit":156},{"width":143,"height":143},"Friendly icon","peak-warehouse-space.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9fb9d950-2c3e-4a43-a975-c773dd47adf3_friendly.svg","YflB_BEAACEA8pcM",{"x":43,"y":43,"zoom":44,"background":45},{"title":158,"content":159,"icon":160},"B8 planning use",[],{"dimensions":161,"alt":162,"copyright":20,"url":163,"id":164,"edit":165},{"width":143,"height":143},"Followed instructions icon","peak-warehouse-space.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0b60c675-436d-4ca1-8857-2bfbff3cb847_followed_instructions.svg","YflB_BEAACIA8pcK",{"x":43,"y":43,"zoom":44,"background":45},{"title":167,"content":168,"icon":169},"Minimum floor space: 3,000 sq feet \u002F 279 sq meters",[],{"dimensions":170,"alt":171,"copyright":20,"url":172,"id":173,"edit":174},{"width":143,"height":143},"Icon of a tape measue","peak-warehouse-space.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fdc53fcd3-c19c-448e-8ed2-440f14cdeee5_size_dimensions.svg","Yh96FRIAACoA-Zrl",{"x":43,"y":43,"zoom":44,"background":45},{"theme":20,"title":176,"description":20},"Ideal space requirements","list_block$220647dd-9f03-4d49-a7b2-501aa931ceb8","list_block",{"variation":16,"version":17,"items":180,"primary":181,"id":220,"slice_type":76,"slice_label":20},[],{"CardImage":182,"CardAvatar":62,"CardTitle":187,"CardText":188,"ButtonText":217,"ButtonUrl":218,"IsEco":74},{"dimensions":183,"alt":20,"copyright":20,"url":184,"id":185,"edit":186},{"width":55,"height":56},"peak-warehouse-space.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ_k_k-vxEdbNO7ut_10.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=148%2C0%2C1624%2C1080&w=1000&h=665","Z_k_k-vxEdbNO7ut",{"x":109,"y":43,"zoom":44,"background":45},"Think we're a perfect fit?",[189,192,196,199,202,205,208,211,214],{"type":24,"text":190,"spans":191,"direction":27},"Explore opportunities to generate extra revenue from your warehouse by simply emailing us at propertysolutions@evri.com with the following information:",[],{"type":193,"text":194,"spans":195,"direction":27},"list-item","Name",[],{"type":193,"text":197,"spans":198,"direction":27},"Business Name",[],{"type":193,"text":200,"spans":201,"direction":27},"Postcode",[],{"type":193,"text":203,"spans":204,"direction":27},"Floor Space",[],{"type":193,"text":206,"spans":207,"direction":27},"Available Parking Spaces",[],{"type":193,"text":209,"spans":210,"direction":27},"Desired Monthly Amount",[],{"type":193,"text":212,"spans":213,"direction":27},"Hours\u002FDays the Space is available",[],{"type":24,"text":215,"spans":216,"direction":27},"We look forward to hearing from you and starting a wonderful partnership this peak season!",[],"Get in t